# Plan: Sidebar Access Restriction & Stage 4 Document Generator Feature

This plan addresses two user requests:
1. **Restricting "+ Job Baru" sidebar menu item** so it is only visible to `marketing` and `superadmin` roles.
2. **Adding a Document Generator feature on Stage 4 (S4 - Pelaksanaan Lapangan Riksa Uji)** allowing assigned Ahli K3, Petugas, and PIC personnel to easily download official field documentation (Surat Tugas, Form Riksa Uji template, and Personnel Credentials).

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Stage 4 Document Generator Scope:**
> 1. **Surat Tugas (.docx)**: Will download the auto-generated Word document populated with Job details, inspection date, unit count, and tagged Ahli K3 & Petugas/PIC.
> 2. **Form Riksa Uji / LHPP Draft Template (.docx)**: Will generate a pre-filled inspection checklist tailored to the equipment type (`pesawat`) for field inspection.
> 3. **Personnel & PJK3 Credentials**: Download links for attached SKP/Lisensi documents and PJK3 certificates.

