### Backend (Laravel Controllers & Routes)

#### [MODIFY] [web.php](file:///d:/Download%20Backup/Lovable/dnp-monitor/dnp-rework/routes/web.php)
- Add new download routes for Stage 4:
  - `GET /jobs/{job}/download-surat-tugas` -> `JobController@downloadSuratTugas`
  - `GET /jobs/{job}/download-form-riksauji` -> `JobController@downloadFormRiksaUji`

#### [MODIFY] [JobController.php](file:///d:/Download%20Backup/Lovable/dnp-monitor/dnp-rework/app/Http/Controllers/JobController.php)
- Add `downloadSuratTugas(Job $job)` method:
  - Ensures `no_surat_tugas` exists (generates if not already generated).
  - Generates or locates the latest `SuratTugas.docx` in `storage/app/public/job-documents/{job->id}/`.
  - Returns `response()->download(...)` with clean headers for instant download on mobile or desktop.
- Add `downloadFormRiksaUji(Job $job)` method:
  - Uses `PhpWord\TemplateProcessor` to dynamically fill equipment form template based on `job->pesawat` and unit details.
  - Returns downloaded `.docx` document ready for Ahli/Petugas to fill out on-site.

